      "writtenOn": "2026-04-23T17:02:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe we can trim it down to only the modules that require KMI changes (most? all?) since no other partner is using them as vendor modules if symbol additions are required. If they don\u0027t need symbol additions, then they can just continue to be vendor modules. The point of this patch is to add as GKI modules instead of adding all the symbols (so unlikely that other partners are impacted)",
      "parentUuid": "3adf3e50_e3175935",
      "revId": "490fd0b7a7a69e3647b0d8cb16e1fa97eec4ab79",
